    {
      "id": "ev-draft-jun07-devonian",
      "type": "yin-sound",
      "title": "Yoga + Sound Bath in the Garden (Alpine)",
      "date": "2026-06-07",
      "time": "18:30",
      "endTime": "21:00",
      "venue": "",
      "price": 49,
      "booking": "https://www.ualberta.ca/en/botanic-garden/events-programs/yoga-in-garden.html",
      "contactEmail": "",
      "contactPhone": "",
      "desc": "\nYoga + Soundbath in the Garden\nFour people sitting on yoga mats doing a side bend in front of waterfall in Aga Khan Garden\n\nYoga in the Garden begins with a gentle and inclusive hour-long yoga practice led by instructor Melanie Maltais. You are encouraged to embrace the beauty of silence during the session, allowing for a deeper connection with breath and sensation. If any movements do not suit you, you are free to modify poses, rest, sit, or lie down at any time. All are welcome as they are.\n\nFollowing a quick break, participants will settle in for a rejuvenating hour-long sound bath. Using instruments tuned to healing frequencies, the sound bath offers a full-body reset to relax the mind, body and spirit. The gentle yoga beforehand allows for the vibrations to resonate more deeply, enhancing the benefits of the sound experience.\n\nTogether, these experiences are designed to support nervous system regulation, inner stillness and deep relaxation.\n\nIncludes yoga, sound bath and admission to the Garden.",
      "status": "published",
      "repeatable": true,
      "venueOverride": "UAlberta Botanic Garden \u2014 Devonian",
      "img": "https://www.ualberta.ca/en/botanic-garden/media-library/events-programs/melanie-yoga.jpg"
    },
